      "name": "LoadOrGetUnitCof",
      "signature": "int LoadOrGetUnitCof(int * param_1, uint param_2, int param_3, undefined4 param_4, undefined4 param_5, int param_6)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "int",
      "comment": "Loads or retrieves a cached COF (Component Object File) animation descriptor for a unit.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate input - assert if ppCofNodeList is NULL\n2. Search existing node list for matching COF by mode and armor code\n3. If found in list, return cached COF data pointer\n4. Build COF file path from token type, mode, weapon, and armor codes\n5. Load COF file asynchronously from disk\n6. Search global cache g_pCofCache for shared COF entry\n7. If found in cache, increment reference count; else allocate new entry\n8. Validate COF header has correct magic byte (0x14 at offset 3)\n9. Link new node into caller's list and return COF data pointer\n\nParameters:\n  ppCofNodeList (ECX) - Pointer to head of caller's COF node list (IMPLICIT __fastcall)\n  dwTokenType (EDX) - Unit token type index: 0-6=global, 7+=local (IMPLICIT __fastcall)\n  nUnitMode - Animation mode index (walk, run, attack, etc.)\n  dwWeaponCode - 4-character weapon code packed as DWORD\n  dwArmorCode - 4-character armor class code packed as DWORD\n  nModeFlags - Additional mode flags (unused in current implementation)\n\nReturns:\n  byte* - Pointer to COF data buffer on success\n  NULL - If file load fails or path is empty\n\nGlobal Data:\n  g_aszModeTokens (0x6f91f0a0) - Mode string lookup table\n  g_aszUnitTokens (0x6f91f040) - Unit type string lookup table\n  g_pCofCache (0x6f96092c) - Global COF cache linked list head\n\nMagic Numbers:\n  0x14 - COF header signature byte at offset 3\n  0x20 - ASCII space character used as padding placeholder\n  0x40 - Path buffer clear size (64 DWORDs = 256 bytes)\n\nStructure Layout (COF Node - 8 bytes):\n  Offset  Size  Field        Description\n  0x00    4     pCofEntry    Pointer to cache entry\n  0x04    4     pNext        Next node in list\n\nStructure Layout (COF Cache Entry - 32 bytes):\n  Offset  Size  Field        Description\n  0x00    4     dwRefCount   Reference count\n  0x04    4     nMode        Animation mode\n  0x08    4     dwType       Token type\n  0x0C    4     dwArmorCode  Armor class code\n  0x10    4     hCofFile     Async file handle\n  0x14    4     pCofData     Loaded COF data\n  0x18    4     pNext        Next cache entry\n  0x1C    4     pPrev        Previous cache entry\n\nError Handling:\n  Assert line 1207: ppCofNodeList is NULL\n  Assert line 1222: Node allocation failed\n  Assert line 988: File load failed\n  Assert line 998: COF header magic invalid\n  Assert line 1225: Cache entry NULL\n  Assert line 1231: COF data pointer NULL\n\nNote: SSA temporaries dwTempCode1, dwTempCode2, abPathBuffer are transient\ndecompiler-generated variables with hash-based storage that reset on reanalysis.",
      "name_source": "Classic/1.09d",
