      "name": "DrawChatUserTooltip",
      "signature": "int DrawChatUserTooltip(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "undefined4",
      "comment": "Draws a tooltip displaying chat user information when hovering over a user in chat.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Allocate 0x1064 bytes of stack space for Unicode text buffers\n2. Validate ECX parameter (chat user data pointer) is non-null; assert if null\n3. Initialize 256 Unicode character buffers (0x100 entries) via default_constructor_closure\n4. Check if user flags allow tooltip display (AND with global config flags at offset 0xC)\n5. Calculate tooltip rect bounds: X +/- 0x1E (30), Y +/- 0x50 (80) around cursor\n6. Call IsPointInRect to verify cursor is within tooltip trigger area\n7. Initialize 7 text line slots (0x208 bytes each) using CallFunctionOnRange\n8. Set active font via SetActiveFont(1) for tooltip rendering\n9. Determine user role type from offset 0x1C and select appropriate label:\n   - 0x11 (17): \"Moderator\" with player count string\n   - 0x12 (18): \"Sysop\"\n   - 0x10 (16): \"Blizzard Rep\"\n   - 0x15 (21): \"Speaker\"\n   - 0x13 (19): \"Referee\"\n   - 0x14 (20): \"Chat\"\n   - 0x16 (22): \"Open Character\"\n10. For standard users, decode product code at offset 0x230:\n    - D2VD/D2XP/D2ST: Skip (Diablo II variants)\n    - DSHR: \"Diablo Shareware\"\n    - DTST/DRTL: \"Diablo\"\n    - JSTR/STAR: \"Starcraft\"\n    - SSHR: \"Starcraft Shareware\"\n    - SEXP: \"Starcraft Expansion\" (Brood War)\n    - W2BN: \"Warcraft II\"\n    - Default: \"Unknown\"\n11. Format each line with sprintf using label templates\n12. Convert ANSI to Unicode via toUnicode for each line\n13. Measure text dimensions with GetUnicodeStringDimensions\n14. Calculate maximum width across all lines (add 6px padding)\n15. Clamp tooltip X position to screen bounds (0 to 0x320/800)\n16. Draw tooltip background via SetRect\n17. Render each text line centered using RenderUnicodeTextWithLineHeight\n\nParameters:\nIMPLICIT ECX - pChatUserData: Pointer to chat user data structure containing:\n  - Offset 0x00: User flags (dword)\n  - Offset 0x14: Cursor Y position (dword)\n  - Offset 0x18: Cursor X position (dword)\n  - Offset 0x1C: User role type (dword) - values 0x10-0x16\n  - Offset 0xCC: Account name string\n  - Offset 0x1EC: Realm name string\n  - Offset 0x22C: Player count for moderator view\n  - Offset 0x230: Product code (4-char magic)\n\nReturns:\n0 - Tooltip not drawn (user data null, flags mismatch, or cursor outside rect)\n1 - Tooltip successfully rendered\n\nMagic Numbers:\n0x1064 - Stack allocation size for buffers\n0x100 (256) - Unicode buffer element count\n0x208 (520) - Size per text line slot (256 wchars + metadata)\n0x50 (80) - Vertical tooltip offset from cursor\n0x1E (30) - Horizontal tooltip offset from cursor\n0x320 (800) - Screen width boundary\n0x6 - Padding added to text dimensions\n\nProduct Code FourCCs:\nD2VD (0x44324456) - Diablo II: Lord of Destruction\nD2XP (0x44325850) - Diablo II Expansion\nD2ST (0x44325354) - Diablo II Stress Test\nDSHR (0x44534852) - Diablo Shareware\nDTST (0x44545354) - Diablo Stress Test\nDRTL (0x4452544c) - Diablo Retail\nJSTR (0x4a535452) - Japan Starcraft\nSTAR (0x53544152) - Starcraft\nSSHR (0x53534852) - Starcraft Shareware\nSEXP (0x53455850) - Starcraft Expansion (Brood War)\nW2BN (0x5732424e) - Warcraft II Battle.net Edition",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
