      "name": "SetCelGlobals",
      "signature": "void SetCelGlobals(uint * pSquelchCel)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Initializes global cel pointers and frame count limits for squelch/select UI.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Store pSquelchCel in g_pSquelchCel\n2. Get frame count from squelch cel, store in g_nSelectFrameMax\n3. Store pSelectedCel in g_pSelectedCel\n4. Get frame count from selected cel, store in g_nSquelchFrameMax\n\nParameters:\n- pSquelchCel (uint*): Pointer to squelch cel file header\n- pSelectedCel (uint*): Pointer to selected cel file header\n\nReturns:\n- void",
