      "name": "GetCurrentFontProperty",
      "signature": "byte GetCurrentFontProperty(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "byte",
      "comment": "Returns a property byte from the current font handle structure.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load current font handle index from g_nCurrentFontIndex\n2. Calculate entry offset using index * 0x14 (20-byte stride)\n3. Load font structure pointer from table\n4. Extract and return byte value at offset +0xa\n\nParameters:\n- IMPLICIT: g_pFontHandles (font handle array)\n- IMPLICIT: g_nCurrentFontIndex (current font index)\n\nReturns:\n- byte: Property value from font handle at offset +0xa\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x14 (20): Font handle entry stride\n- 0xa (10): Property byte offset in structure",
      "name_source": "Classic/1.00",
      "method": "NOP",
