      "name": "CopyStringWithBufferInit",
      "signature": "void CopyStringWithBufferInit(wchar_t * lpwszSource, dword dwMaxWidth, dword nBaseHeight, dword dwOutputValue, dword dwAlignMode, dword dwEffectScale)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Initializes the global string buffer and configures text rendering settings.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if lpwszSource is NULL or its length exceeds 0x3FF (1023)\n2. If invalid: Clear the 0x800-byte (2048 dword) global string buffer\n3. If valid: Copy lpwszSource into the global string buffer using Unicode::strcpy\n4. Store rendering configuration parameters in globals:\n   - g_dwMaxWidth: Maximum text width limit\n   - g_nBaseHeight: Base line height\n   - g_dwOutputValue: Output/destination value\n   - g_dwAlignMode: Text alignment mode flags\n   - g_dwEffectScale: Effect/shadow scale factor\n\nParameters:\n- lpwszSource (wchar_t *): Pointer to source Unicode string or NULL\n- dwMaxWidth (dword): Maximum width constraint\n- nBaseHeight (dword): Base height value\n- dwOutputValue (dword): Output destination specification\n- dwAlignMode (dword): Alignment flags\n- dwEffectScale (dword): Scale factor for effects\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nNotes:\n- Buffer overflow protection: Strings exceeding 1023 characters reset buffer\n- Operates on global buffer at g_pszStringBuffer (512 dword slots = 2048 bytes)\n- Used for configuring text rendering pipeline",
      "name_source": "Classic/1.00",
      "method": "NOP",
      "index": "NOP:7941c871f3a897d3aa5091a05643e3e27906ddc01028eac78c2dc1b1e400b4e5",
