      "name": "RenderUnicodeTextWithLineHeight",
      "signature": "void RenderUnicodeTextWithLineHeight(Unicode * pszText, int nX, int nY, int nColor, int nLineHeight)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Renders Unicode string with colors, calculating width if line height is specified.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Initialize width to 0\n2. If line height is non-zero, calculate string display width and add 8-pixel padding\n3. Call RenderUnicodeStringWithColors with calculated width\n\nParameters:\n- pszText (Unicode*): String to render\n- nX (int): X coordinate\n- nY (int): Y coordinate\n- nColor (int): Text color\n- nLineHeight (int): Line height (if 0, width calculated as 0)\n\nReturns:\n- void",
      "name_source": "Classic/1.00",
