      "name": "RenderTextString",
      "signature": "void RenderTextString(ushort * pSrcString, uint nXPos, Unicode * pDstBuffer)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Renders a Unicode text string at specified position with font metrics handling.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Get source string length and clear 18-dword metrics buffer\n2. Set initial font index and metrics from global state\n3. Iterate through source string characters:\n   - Skip multi-byte characters (0xFF prefix, 6-byte sequences)\n   - Handle newline (0x0A): reset X, adjust Y down by font descender height\n   - Process normal character: fetch glyph metrics, render via Ordinal_10072, advance X\n4. Update font index from global state after each non-newline character\n\nParameters:\n- pwszSrc (Unicode*): Input text string to render\n- nXPos (int): Starting X position in pixels\n- pwszDst (Unicode*): Output buffer for rendered text data\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x12 (18): Stack buffer size in dwords (72 bytes)\n- 0x0A: Newline character code\n- 0xFF: Multi-byte character prefix\n- 0xF: Font height divisor for descender calculation\n- 0x14 (20): Font handle structure stride",
      "name_source": "Classic/1.00",
      "method": "NOP",
      "index": "NOP:afe570a031731cbf17dca52380a5056f828f9652b7790f47e2e36efed5183174",
