      "name": "LoadPentagramImage",
      "signature": "void LoadPentagramImage(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Loads the pentagram cursor image.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if pentagram image is already loaded (g_pPentagramImage != NULL)\n2. Assert if already loaded (debug check for double-initialization)\n3. Format the image path using UI_CURSOR_Pentspin template\n4. Load the cel image from the formatted path\n5. Store loaded image in global g_pPentagramImage\n\nParameters:\n- None\n\nReturns:\n- None (result stored in g_pPentagramImage)",
