      "name": "InitPentagramResources",
      "signature": "bool InitPentagramResources(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "undefined4",
      "comment": "Initializes the pentagram resource system and core data tables.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Initialize subsystem via Ordinal_10115\n2. Set game state via Ordinal_10127(1)\n3. Load pentagram image resource\n4. Initialize additional subsystem via Ordinal_10157\n5. Query table resource size (0x1c bytes)\n6. Clear g_dwCurrentValue flag/counter\n7. Load table data via Ordinal_10027\n8. Register/apply table via ProcessDataEntries\n9. Finalize subsystem via Ordinal_10177\n10. Clear g_dwGameState flag/counter\n\nParameters:\n- None\n\nReturns:\n- true on success\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x1c (28): Table entry stride/size in bytes",
