      "name": "SetCurrentInputPointer",
      "signature": "int SetCurrentInputPointer(int * pInputPtr)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "int",
      "comment": "Sets the current input pointer in the global focus tracker.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load current input pointer from global\n2. If global not null and different from input, call cleanup (Ordinal_10083)\n3. Store new input pointer to global\n4. Return success\n\nParameters:\n- pInputPtr (int*): Pointer to the new input control\n\nReturns:\n1 (always succeeds)",
      "name_source": "Classic/1.00",
