      "name": "InitializeGraphicsContext",
      "signature": "void InitializeGraphicsContext(GfxContext * pContext)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Initializes graphics context and cleanup timer based on context state.\n\nClassification: Initialization function\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if context dwInitState field is zero (first-time init)\n2. If zero: Call D2GFX.Ordinal_10025(1) to enable graphics state\n3. If non-zero: Check if exception handling active via GetExceptionActiveFlag\n4. If no exception active: Call D2GFX.Ordinal_10025(0) and InitializeCleanupTimer(true)\n5. Call Gfx_InitializeDevice to initialize graphics rendering device\n6. If device init returns non-zero: Call D2GFX.Ordinal_10026 post-init handler\n7. Clear context dwPendingFlag field at offset 0x18\n8. Return\n\nParameters:\npContext (GfxContext*): Pointer to graphics context structure\n  dwInitState (+0x08): Init state flag - 0 for first init, non-zero for re-init\n  dwPendingFlag (+0x18): Pending operation flag - cleared on init completion\n\nReturns:\nvoid\n\nCallees:\nD2GFX.Ordinal_10025: Set graphics initialization state (0=disabled, 1=enabled)\nFOG.GetExceptionActiveFlag: Check if exception handler is active\nInitializeCleanupTimer: Enable palette cleanup timer (fEnable=true)\nD2GFX.Gfx_InitializeDevice: Initialize graphics device, returns status\nD2GFX.Ordinal_10026: Post-device initialization handler\n\nDecompiler Discrepancies:\nextraout_var and iVar1 are decompiler SSA temporaries not accessible for renaming\nCONCAT31 artifact represents full EAX register check after GetExceptionActiveFlag\n\nSpecial Cases:\nFirst-time init (dwInitState==0) skips exception check and enables gfx state\nRe-init only enables cleanup timer if no active exception",
      "name_source": "Classic/1.00",
      "method": "NOP",
      "index": "NOP:200955eb308c9e3cdba71db646328584b34dc74b425c7afe1136727d93a8cf07",
