      "name": "LoadPaletteData",
      "signature": "uint LoadPaletteData(uint dwPaletteId, uint dwModeId)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "undefined4",
      "comment": "Loads palette data from WAD files and initializes color mapping tables.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Allocate temp buffer via GetUnitX and load base palette (256x3 RGB bytes) from WAD dwPaletteId\n2. Convert 3-byte RGB palette to 4-byte RGBX format with zero padding in abPaletteBuffer\n3. Allocate temp buffer and load mode-specific palette tables (696KB) from WAD dwModeId\n4. Copy 11 palette subtables to global memory locations (total ~850KB):\n   - g_pPaletteData: 256 DWORD palette entries (1KB)\n   - DWORD_6f98546c: 0xC000 DWORDs main color tables (192KB)\n   - g_adCopySource: 0xC40 DWORDs secondary lookup (12KB)\n   - DWORD_6f9b556c/6f961568/6f97156c: 0x4000 DWORDs each (64KB each)\n   - DWORD_6f98356c: 0x400 DWORDs (4KB)\n   - DWORD_6f98456c/6f98466c: 0x40 DWORDs each (256 bytes each)\n   - g_pDataTable: 0x2000 DWORDs (32KB)\n   - DWORD_6f9c556c: 39 bytes mixed copy\n   - DWORD_6f98476c: 0x340 DWORDs (3KB)\n5. Initialize g_abColorTableEntries with value 5 (default blend mode)\n6. Build brightness-adjusted color lookup via FindClosestColorMatch:\n   - Scale RGB by 170% (0xAA/100), clamp to 255\n   - Store adjusted palette indices at g_adwData_6f9c599c+0x7FF8\n   - Store grayscale equivalents at g_adwData_6f985474+0x2FFF8\n7. Build lookup table pointer arrays (adStack_520, aiStack_450)\n8. Call InitializeGraphicsAndData with pointer table\n9. Call UpdatePaletteReference to apply palette\n10. Free both temp allocation buffers via ReleasePoolAllocation\n\nParameters:\n- dwPaletteId (ECX): Resource ID for base 256-color palette WAD file\n- dwModeId (EDX): Resource ID for mode-specific palette tables WAD file\n\nReturns:\n- 1: Always returns success (no error paths)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x63 (99): Resource allocation flags for base palette\n- 0x72 (114): Resource allocation flags for mode data\n- 0xAA (170): Brightness scale factor (170% = 1.7x)\n- 0x51eb851f: Magic divisor for fast division by 100\n- 5: Default color table blend mode value\n- 0x100 (256): Palette entry count\n\nStructure Layout (Mode Data Buffer at EBP):\nOffset    Size      Destination              Description\n0x0000    0x400     g_pPaletteData           Base palette (256 DWORDs)\n0x0400    0x3100    g_adCopySource           Secondary lookup (0xC40 DWORDs)\n0x2400    0x1000    DWORD_6f98356c           Blend table (0x400 DWORDs)\n0x3400    0x100     DWORD_6f98456c           Mini table (0x40 DWORDs)\n0x3500    0x30000   DWORD_6f98546c           Main tables (0xC000 DWORDs)\n0x33500   0x10000   DWORD_6f961568           Extended table 1 (0x4000 DWORDs)\n0x43500   0x10000   DWORD_6f9b556c           Extended table 2 (0x4000 DWORDs)\n0x53500   0x8000    g_pDataTable             Data table (0x2000 DWORDs)\n0x5B500   0x10000   DWORD_6f97156c           Extended table 3 (0x4000 DWORDs)\n0x6B500   0x100     DWORD_6f98466c           Mini table 2 (0x40 DWORDs)\n0x6B600   0x27      DWORD_6f9c556c           Mixed data (39 bytes)\n0x6B627   0xD00     DWORD_6f98476c           Final table (0x340 DWORDs)",
      "name_source": "Classic/1.04b",
