      "name": "FindPaletteIndexForColor",
      "signature": "uint FindPaletteIndexForColor(byte byRed, byte byGreen, byte byBlue)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "uint",
      "comment": "Finds the palette index for an RGB color.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Extract R, G, B color components (8-bit values)\n2. Call FindClosestColorMatch with palette pointer and RGB values\n3. Returns palette index of closest matching color\n\nParameters:\n- byRed (byte): Red component (0-255)\n- byGreen (byte): Green component (0-255)\n- byBlue (byte): Blue component (0-255)\n\nReturns:\n- Palette index (0-255) of the closest matching color",
      "name_source": "Classic/1.00",
