      "name": "FreeListData",
      "signature": "void FreeListData(int * pListData)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "undefined4",
      "comment": "Frees all allocated nodes in a linked list data structure.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate input is correct type (0xc = list data type)\n2. Get head of linked list from offset 0x10\n3. Iterate through chain, following next pointer at offset 0x34\n4. Release each node's pool allocation\n\nParameters:\n- pListData (int*): Pointer to list data structure containing head pointer\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0xc: Expected list data type identifier\n- 0x10: Offset to list head pointer\n- 0x34: Offset to next pointer in linked list node",
