      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Wrapper for SetTextDataLine. Sets Unicode text at specified line/column position.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Receives text data structure pointer in ECX (fastcall)\n2. Receives Unicode text pointer in EDX\n3. Delegates to SetTextDataLine with all parameters\n4. Returns void (callee handles validation/allocation)\n\nParameters:\n- pTextData (int*): Text data structure pointer (ECX)\n- wszText (wchar_t*): Unicode text string to set (EDX)\n- nLineIndex (int): Line index in text structure\n- nColumnIndex (int): Column index for text placement\n\nReturns:\n- void (no return value)\n\nRelated Functions:\n- SetTextDataLine: Implementation function that performs the actual work",
