      "name": "ValidateMonsterPaletteHandle",
      "signature": "void ValidateMonsterPaletteHandle(uint dwPaletteHandle, int nStatus)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "undefined",
      "comment": "Validates monster palette handle and initializes palette system.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Copy status parameter from EDX to ECX\n2. Test if status value is zero (failure flag)\n3. If zero: invoke assertion failure with line 0x49 (73 decimal) and call error handler with -0x1 (0xFFFFFFFF) for fatal crash\n4. If non-zero: jump to Ordinal_10103 (Storm.dll file palette initialization function)\n5. Return from function\n\nParameters:\ndwPaletteHandle (uint): Palette resource handle from file system\nnStatus (int): Status flag from load operation (0=failure/error, non-zero=success/valid)\n\nReturns:\nvoid - function does not return on error path (fatal assertion + crash)\nSuccess path falls through to Storm.dll Ordinal_10103 palette initialization\n\nSpecial Cases:\nZero status triggers assertion at line 73 and non-returning crash path\n\nRelated Ordinals:\nOrdinal_10103 = Storm.dll palette file initialization routine",
      "name_source": "Classic/1.04b",
      "method": "NOP",
