      "name": "ValidateLocaleCode",
      "signature": "undefined4 ValidateLocaleCode(int param_1, int param_2)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "undefined4",
      "comment": "Validates a locale code against current system configuration.\n\nAlgorithm:\n  1. Mask locale code to 0x3ff and apply 0x400 flag via g_pfnLocaleHandler\n  2. Call locale handler to convert locale ID to locale name in szLocaleBuffer\n  3. Return 0 (failure) if handler call fails\n  4. Extract locale code from locale name via FUN_00409cc7\n  5. If extracted code equals dwLocaleCode, return 1 (success)\n  6. If nCheckStrict is 0, return 1 (non-strict validation passes)\n  7. Compare retrieved locale name length with system locale string length\n  8. Return 0 if lengths differ (strict mismatch), else 1 (success)\n\nParameters:\n  dwLocaleCode: Locale ID to validate (masked to 0x3ff with 0x400 flag)\n  nCheckStrict: Strict validation flag; if non-zero, must match system locale\n\nReturns:\n  1: Validation successful (code matched or non-strict mode)\n  0: Validation failed (handler error or locale mismatch in strict mode)",
      "name_source": "Classic/1.00",
      "method": "NOP",
      "index": "NOP:5d7f77a7374218cf0a084a9b23a5f4a229600b16e133d3ce90ada791e93124c8",
