      "name": "SetEditControlValue",
      "signature": "void SetEditControlValue(int * pEdit, int nValue)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Sets a value in an edit control structure.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validates pEdit is not NULL (assertion)\n2. Validates pEdit[0] equals 1 (type check)\n3. Writes nValue to pEdit[0x12]\n\nParameters:\n- pEdit (int*): Pointer to edit control structure\n- nValue (int): Value to write at offset 0x12\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x12 (18): Offset where value is written in edit structure\n- 1: Expected value at pEdit[0] (type identifier)",
      "name_source": "Classic/1.04b",
