      "name": "SetActiveFont",
      "signature": "uint SetActiveFont(uint nFontId)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "uint",
      "comment": "Sets the active font and manages the font cache, loading new resources on demand.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Store current font index, update time cache\n2. If font changed, load new font CEL image if not cached\n3. Initialize font table for newly loaded fonts\n4. Periodically scan cache and release unused fonts (>240ms idle)\n5. Update global font pointer and rendering callback\n\nParameters:\n- nFontId (int): Font ID to activate (0-0xd)\n\nReturns:\n- int: Previous font ID value\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x4f (79): Max font path length\n- 0x14 (20): Font cache entry stride (5 DWORDs)\n- 0xf0 (240): Idle threshold (ms) for releasing fonts\n- 0x258 (600): Scan interval (ms) for cache cleanup",
      "name_source": "Classic/1.04b",
      "method": "NOP",
      "index": "NOP:4f226ed7b4d3704ca401bc47f6621b85bb8280cee0b5dee19fc10bceae50abbb",
