      "name": "CalculateTextBoxLineCount",
      "signature": "int CalculateTextBoxLineCount(int * pTextBox)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "undefined4",
      "comment": "Calculate the number of text lines that fit in a TextBox control.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate pTextBox is non-null (assert line 602)\n2. Validate pTextBox type is 4 (TextBox control, assert line 603)\n3. SetActiveFont using font index from pTextBox offset 0x94\n4. Extract dimensions: nY from offset 0x44, nX from offset 0x18\n5. Get base font height via GetCurrentFontProperty\n6. Check locale via GetLanguageLocaleId for CJK adjustment:\n   - Locale 7 (Chinese) or 9 (Korean): Adjust g_dwCJKFontHeight\n   - Font height >= 14: Use CJK height 8\n   - Font height 8-13: Use CJK height 7\n   - Font height <= 7: Use CJK height 6\n7. Calculate: ((nX - nY*2) - fontHeight) / (fontProp + cjkHeight) + 1\n\nParameters:\n- pTextBox (int*): Pointer to TextBox control structure (__fastcall via ECX)\n  - Offset 0x00: Control type (must be 4)\n  - Offset 0x18: nX (width)\n  - Offset 0x44: nY (padding)\n  - Offset 0x94: Font index\n\nReturns:\n- int: Number of text lines that fit in the TextBox\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Null pTextBox: Asserts and calls ReportError(-1)\n- Non-TextBox type: Asserts and calls ReportError(-1)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 4: TextBox control type identifier\n- 7: Chinese (Simplified) locale ID\n- 9: Korean locale ID\n- 6, 7, 8: CJK font height adjustment values\n- 14 (0xE): Font height threshold for CJK adjustment\n\nGlobals:\n- g_dwCJKFontHeight (0x6f921934): CJK font spacing adjustment",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "NOP",
      "index": "NOP:a740e930d568e17b0d5144feaca7fba94826fb9dc4b6581f7c54ff300e5a24fc",
