      "name": "LoadItemTypesTable",
      "signature": "void LoadItemTypesTable(void * pBinFile)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "undefined",
      "comment": "Loads the itemtypes.txt Excel table and stores result in g_pItemTypesTable.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Set up 4 linked column definitions on stack (code, equiv1, equiv2, end)\n2. Call AllocAndZeroBuffer16 to allocate buffer, store in g_pItemTypesData\n3. Call LoadExcelTableData with table name, column defs, row stride 0xEC (236)\n4. Store returned table pointer in g_pItemTypesTable\n\nParameters:\n- pBinFile (void*): ECX - binary file context for Excel loader\n\nReturns:\n- void (no return value)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x0A (10): Field type for \"code\" column\n- 0x0D (13): Field type for linked columns (equiv1, equiv2)\n- 4, 5: Column indices for equiv1 and equiv2 links\n- 0xEC (236): Row stride in bytes for itemtypes table",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "NOP",
