      "name": "LoadCompositeUnitCof",
      "signature": "int LoadCompositeUnitCof(void * pCompositeUnit)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "undefined4",
      "comment": "Loads COF (Composite Object Format) data for a composite unit.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate pCompositeUnit is not NULL (assert)\n2. Check unit mode, class, and weapon class indices against limits\n3. Reset to fallback values (7, 5, 1) if any index out of bounds\n4. Get COF node list from pCompositeUnit->pGfxInfo (offset 0xB8)\n5. Call LoadOrGetUnitCof with mode, class, weapon class code\n6. On failure, retry with fallback mode=7, class=5, weapon=1\n7. Assert on second failure\n\nParameters:\n- pCompositeUnit (void*): Pointer to composite unit structure\n\nReturns:\n- 1: Always returns success (asserts on failure)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x1C: Offset to unit mode index\n- 0x20: Offset to unit class index\n- 0x24: Offset to weapon class index\n- 0xB8: Offset to pGfxInfo (COF node list pointer)\n- 7: Default unit mode (fallback)\n- 5: Default unit class (fallback)\n- 1: Default weapon class (fallback)",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "STR",
      "index": "STR:6f7631978ae4b0dd2e9929769954c5b9",
