      "name": "RemapComponentIndex",
      "signature": "void RemapComponentIndex(int nMode, byte * pbyCompIdx)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "undefined",
      "comment": "Remaps a component index based on item type equivalence checks.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. If nMode is 1-4 (equipment mode) and component index > 3:\n   a. Check item type against shield (0x03), helm (0x10), armor (0x0F), weapon (0x02)\n   b. For each matching type, search g_adwComponentTypeTable for matching record\n   c. If found in table, update component index to table position\n   d. If not found, apply fallback formula: (idx % 3) + 1\n2. If nMode is 0 (circlet mode):\n   a. First check if frame already has circlet type (0x25)\n   b. If not, check if item has circlet type and search component table\n   c. Remap to matching component or default to index 1\n\nParameters:\n- nMode (int, ECX): Processing mode selector\n  - 0: Circlet check mode - handles circlet item remapping\n  - 1-4: Equipment type modes - handles shield/helm/armor/weapon\n- pbyCompIdx (byte*, EDX): Pointer to component index to remap (modified in place)\n\nReturns:\n- void: Modifies *pbyCompIdx in place with remapped index\n\nLocals:\n- fIsMatch (bool): Result of IsItemTypeEquivalent check\n- nSearchIdx (int): Loop counter for component table search\n- pdwCompType (dword*): Pointer traversing g_adwComponentTypeTable\n- extraout_var* (undefined3): Decompiler artifacts from CONCAT31 - not real variables\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x03: Shield item type\n- 0x10: Helm item type (16)\n- 0x0F: Armor item type (15)\n- 0x02: Weapon item type\n- 0x25: Circlet item type (37)\n- 0x0C: Component record stride (12 bytes per entry)\n- 0x6F91F1D0: Component type lookup table (item class ID)\n- 0x6F91F1C8: Component frame ID table\n- 0x6F924BE0: g_adwComponentTypeTable base address\n- 0x6F9608F4: g_nComponentTypeCount\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Index <= 3: No remapping needed (valid base index)\n- Table search failure: Falls back to (idx % 3) + 1 formula\n- Circlet mode with no match: Defaults to index 1",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "NOP",
      "index": "NOP:f1eb21133f55167195395910cbae546a22877e621da4c93e872b529f3da0b95d",
