      "name": "RenderTextWithShadow",
      "signature": "void RenderTextWithShadow(Unicode * pszText, int nWidth, int nHeight)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Renders Unicode text with shadow effect using current font settings.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Get character display width and font handle info\n2. Clamp text position to viewport bounds (ESI is viewport width, EBX is viewport height)\n3. Calculate text height with 2-pixel shadow offset\n4. Call rendering functions to draw shadow and text with colors\n\nParameters:\n- pszText (Unicode*): Null-terminated Unicode string to render\n- nWidth (int): X coordinate offset for text rendering\n- nHeight (int): Y coordinate offset for text rendering\n- IMPLICIT: EBX contains viewport height, ESI contains viewport width\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0xa: Offset in font handle structure to character width byte\n- 0x1f: Height padding/margin (31 pixels)\n- 0x2: Shadow offset (2 pixels)",
      "name_source": "Classic/1.09d",
      "method": "NOP",
      "index": "NOP:b57368661df1c55306d0ffcac2bf2eecfdb1d0349a9245c950a86ef50f174851",
