      "name": "InitializeApplicationCore",
      "signature": "int InitializeApplicationCore(uint dwParam1, uint dwParam2)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "int",
      "comment": "Initializes core application systems including memory and graphics engine.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Set initialization flag to mark system startup phase\n2. Call Ordinal_10023 to initialize resource subsystem; abort if fails\n3. Initialize graphics system with fixed memory configuration\n4. Initialize auxiliary subsystem via Ordinal_10027\n5. Initialize callback depth counter and memory tracking tables\n6. Store initialization parameters for runtime access\n\nParameters:\n- dwParam1 (uint): Resource initialization parameter\n- dwParam2 (uint): Configuration parameter\n\nReturns:\n- 1 on success (all subsystems initialized)\n- 0 if Ordinal_10023 fails during resource initialization",
