      "name": "ClearTextDataLine",
      "signature": "undefined ClearTextDataLine(int * param_1, int param_2)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "undefined",
      "comment": "Clears a specific line from a text data structure and releases its pool allocations.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate pTextData is not NULL and type equals 4 (D2WIN_TEXTBOX)\n2. Verify nLineNum is within bounds (< nNumLines at offset 0x54)\n3. Traverse linked list from pFirstLine (offset 0x48) to reach target line\n4. Assert traversal reached valid line and count matches request\n5. Clear 5 fields at the line and release pool allocations for each\n\nParameters:\n- pTextData (int*): Pointer to text data structure (ECX)\n- nLineNum (int): Zero-based line number to clear (EDX)\n\nReturns:\n- void (asserts on failure, no return value)",
