      "name": "GetCompositeWeaponClass",
      "signature": "int GetCompositeWeaponClass(byte * pbComponents, int nUnitType)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "int",
      "comment": "Determines composite weapon class from two component slots.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Read left-hand component (offset +5) and right-hand (offset +6)\n2. For each slot: lookup base weapon class from component tables\n3. If class is sheath (0xD/0xE) and unit type != 6, use alternate class\n4. If IsItemTypeEquivalent(component, 0x32), use alternate class\n5. Combine left/right classes using priority rules\n\nParameters:\n- pbComponents (byte*): Component array, offsets +5/+6 are LH/RH slots\n- nUnitType (int): Unit type (6 = special sheath handling)\n\nReturns:\n- Combined weapon class code (1-14), or 0 on invalid combination\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x32 (50): Melee weapon item type\n- 0xD (13), 0xE (14): Sheath weapon classes\n- 0xB (11): Dual-wield combination class\n- 0xA (10): Paired shield class\n- 0xC (12): Component table stride",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "NOP",
      "index": "NOP:f3a543a24b1ecba412b2c73b10f91a59fe9cc64de284aedb06a92a9f6d3c9e7b",
