      "name": "CreateUnicodeString",
      "signature": "int * CreateUnicodeString(Unicode * pString, int nMaxLen, int nApplyTransform)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "int *",
      "comment": "Allocates and initializes a Unicode string header structure.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Assert nMaxLen < 200 characters, terminate if invalid\n2. Allocate 8-byte header structure via FogMemAlloc\n3. If nApplyTransform and first character < 0x100, apply character transformation\n4. Decrement nMaxLen after successful transform\n5. Allocate string buffer (nMaxLen * 2 + 2 bytes for Unicode + null terminator)\n6. Store allocated buffer pointer in header[0]\n7. Store zero in header[1] (unused/reserved field)\n8. Copy source string to buffer with null termination\n\nParameters:\n- pString (Unicode*): Pointer to source Unicode string\n- nMaxLen (int): Maximum string length in characters (validated < 200)\n- nApplyTransform (int): Non-zero to apply character transformation\n\nReturns:\n- int*: Pointer to allocated 8-byte header structure; header[0] contains string pointer",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "STR",
      "index": "STR:b5d1c557d03acfc18d9d7e4d9cf6cd2a",
