      "name": "CleanupArchiveHandle",
      "signature": "void CleanupArchiveHandle(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "undefined",
      "comment": "CleanupArchiveHandle - Closes and resets archive handle\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load the archive handle value from the structure at [ESI+0x0]\n2. Check if the handle is non-zero (valid/open)\n3. If valid, call Ordinal_252 to close/free the handle\n4. Clear the handle field to zero\n5. Call Ordinal_10043 with line 622 from Archive.cpp for cleanup verification\n\nParameters:\n  IMPLICIT ESI - pArchiveHandle (int*): Pointer to archive handle structure\n\nReturns:\n  void\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - If handle is already zero (null), skip the close operation\n  - Line number 0x26e (622) references Archive.cpp:622\n  - EDX points to source file path \"..\\\\Source\\\\D2Hell\\\\SRC\\\\Archive.cpp\"\n\nStructure Layout:\nOffset | Size | Field Name      | Type  | Description\n-------|------|-----------------|-------|---------------------------\n+0x00  | 4    | hArchive        | int   | Archive handle (HANDLE or file descriptor)",
