      "name": "RenderTextBoxControl",
      "signature": "int RenderTextBoxControl(UIControl * pControl)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "undefined4",
      "comment": "Renders a multi-line text box control with scrolling and column support\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate control pointer is not null and dwType equals 4 (text box type)\n2. Check control flags at offset +0x8 against global bitmask requirements\n3. Initialize tooltip context if tooltip pointer exists at offset +0x4\n4. Calculate base positioning using control dimensions and animation delays\n5. Handle vertical scroll up if flag 0x40 set - decrement scroll offset by 2\n6. Handle vertical scroll down if flag 0x80 set - advance to next line node\n7. Iterate through linked list of text line nodes starting at offset +0x50\n8. For each line, iterate through columns (count at offset +0x64)\n9. Calculate horizontal text position based on alignment flags and column offsets\n10. Initialize 2048-character Unicode buffer and copy text for truncation\n11. Render selected line with inverted colors if current line matches selection\n12. Render text using appropriate function based on scroll mode and flags\n13. Advance Y position by line spacing plus difficulty-adjusted line height\n14. Continue until all visible lines rendered or remaining height exhausted\n15. Finalize rendering and return success status\n\nParameters:\n  pControl (ECX) - Pointer to UIControl structure containing text box state\n\nReturns:\n  1 on successful rendering\n  0 if control flags validation failed\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Error code 0x3bc if pControl is NULL\n  - Error code 0x3bd if dwType at offset +0x0 is not 4\n  - Scroll offset at +0x9c decremented by 2 when scrolling up (flag 0x40)\n  - Scroll offset reset to 0 when reaching top, wraps to width-padding value\n  - When scrolling down (flag 0x80), advances to next line at offset +0x1c\n  - Selected line at offset +0x60 rendered with inverted colors when flag 0x1 set\n  - Text color value 4 replaced with 3 for selected lines\n  - Column alignment: flag 0x2=center, flag 0x10=right, default=left\n  - Alignment calculated using Ordinal_10055 (text width measurement)\n  - Text truncated to column width using TruncateUnicodeStringToPixelWidth\n\nStructure Layout (UIControl TextBox variant):\nOffset | Size | Field Name           | Type        | Description\n-------|------|----------------------|-------------|---------------------------\n  +0x0 |    4 | dwType               | DWORD       | Control type (must be 4)\n  +0x4 |    4 | pTooltipData         | void*       | Tooltip context pointer\n  +0x8 |  508 | reserved             | byte[508]   | Control state data\n +0x50 |    4 | pFirstLine           | TextLine*   | Head of line linked list (at reserved+0x48)\n +0x54 |    1 | bControlFlags        | byte        | Flags: 0x1=selected 0x2=center 0x10=right 0x40=scroll_up 0x80=scroll_down (at reserved+0x4c)\n +0x58 |    4 | nSelectionBase       | int         | Selection base index (at reserved+0x50)\n +0x5c |    4 | nColumnCount         | int         | Number of columns per line (at reserved+0x54)\n +0x60 |   20 | columnOffsets[5]     | int[5]      | Custom X offsets for columns (at reserved+0x58)\n +0x74 |   20 | columnFlags[5]       | DWORD[5]    | Alignment flags per column (at reserved+0x6c)\n +0x94 |    4 | nScrollOffset        | int         | Vertical scroll position (at reserved+0x8c)\n +0x98 |    4 | nSpacingNormal       | int         | Line spacing for normal lines (at reserved+0x90)\n +0x9c |    4 | nSpacingSpecial      | int         | Line spacing for special lines (at reserved+0x94)\n\nTextLineNode Structure (at pFirstLine):\nOffset | Size | Field Name           | Type        | Description\n-------|------|----------------------|-------------|---------------------------\n  +0x0 |   20 | columnTexts[5]       | Unicode*[5] | Pointers to column text\n +0x14 |    4 | dwColor              | DWORD       | Text color value\n +0x18 |    1 | bIsSpecialLine       | byte        | Line type flag (affects spacing)\n +0x1c |    4 | pNextLine            | TextLine*   | Next line in linked list",
      "name_source": "LoD/PD2",
