      "name": "InitializeGameDllLibraries",
      "signature": "int InitializeGameDllLibraries(uint dwGameVersion)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Initializes Diablo II game DLL libraries and subsystems.\n   \n   Algorithm:\n   1. Load D2Data.dll with timeout 0x3E8 (1000ms), store in g_pD2DataDllHandle\n   2. Load D2SFX.dll with timeout 0x3E8 (1000ms), store in g_pD2SfxDllHandle\n   3. Load D2Speech.dll with timeout 0x3E8 (1000ms), store in g_pD2SpeechDllHandle\n   4. Load D2Delta.dll with timeout 0x3E8 (1000ms), store in g_pD2DeltaDllHandle\n   5. Load D2KoreanFixup.dll with timeout 0x3E8 (1000ms), store in g_pD2KoreanFixupDllHandle\n   6. Load Patch_D2.dll with timeout 0x1388 (5000ms), store in g_pPatchD2DllHandle\n   7. Load D2Expansion.dll with timeout 0xBB8 (3000ms), store in g_pD2ExpansionDllHandle\n   8. Call ImportThunk_Ordinal_10117() to initialize primary subsystems\n   9. Check if step 8 failed (return != 0), jump to NullPaddingRegion if failed\n   10. Verify all critical DLLs loaded (g_pD2DataDllHandle, g_pD2SfxDllHandle, g_pD2SpeechDllHandle)\n   11. Call IndirectJumpThunk_SecondaryInit() for secondary initialization\n   12. If secondary init fails OR g_pD2ExpansionDllHandle loaded, jump to NullPaddingRegion\n   13. Return 0 on all error paths, jump to NullPaddingRegion on success\n   \n   Parameters:\n     dwGameVersion: Game version identifier (unused in this implementation)\n   \n   Returns:\n     0 on failure (any critical DLL load fails or initialization fails)\n     Jumps to NullPaddingRegion on success (which handles actual return value)\n   \n   Special Cases:\n     - D2Data, D2SFX, D2Speech are critical; function returns 0 if any fail to load\n     - D2Expansion.dll status affects secondary initialization flow\n     - Timeouts vary: standard DLLs use 1000ms, Patch_D2 uses 5000ms, D2Expansion uses 3000ms\n     - NullPaddingRegion likely contains return 1 or continuation logic\n     - All DLL handles stored as global pointers with g_p prefix for global pointer Hungarian notation",
      "name_source": "LoD/PD2",
      "method": "STR",
      "index": "STR:39b19f357ff00f3073f2b84c46f9102a",
