      "name": "InitializeExcelScreenshotGlobals",
      "signature": "void InitializeExcelScreenshotGlobals(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Initializes global Excel screenshot configuration and captures Excel data file.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Allocate 0x50 bytes on stack for ScreenshotConfig structure array\n2. Call Ordinal_10211 with source file path and line number 0xa8c for debug logging\n3. Store result in global DAT_6f9a8ca4\n4. Build ScreenshotConfig array on stack with 4 entries:\n   - Entry 0: filename=\"code\", width=10 (0xa)\n   - Entry 1: global pointer 0x6f9a8ca4, filename=\"type\", count=15 (0xf)\n   - Entry 2: unused, count=4\n   - Entry 3: global pointer 0x6f9a8ca4, filename offset, count=6\n5. Call CreateExcelDataScreenshot with stack config array and parameters\n6. Store returned image data pointer in global DAT_6f9a8ca8\n7. Clean up stack and return\n\nParameters:\n  None\n\nReturns:\n  void\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Source file path: \"..\\\\Source\\\\D2Win\\\\Src\\\\D2Comp.cpp\"\n  - Line number: 0xa8c (2700 decimal)\n  - nHeight parameter: 0xe4 (228 decimal)\n  - String pointer: 0x6f8fcd90 points to \"code\" string\n  - Global DAT_6f9a8ca4 stores Ordinal_10211 result\n  - Global DAT_6f9a8ca8 stores CreateExcelDataScreenshot result\n  - Function uses __stdcall convention with RET 0x4 cleanup\n\nStructure Layout:\nStack Config Array (0x50 bytes total):\nOffset | Size | Field Name       | Type    | Description\n-------|------|------------------|---------|----------------------------------\n  0x00 |  0x4 | szFilename1      | char*   | Pointer to \"code\" (0x6f8fcd90)\n  0x04 |  0x4 | nWidth1          | int     | Width value 10 (0xa)\n  0x08 |  0x4 | reserved1        | int     | Zero\n  0x0c |  0x4 | reserved2        | int     | Zero\n  0x10 |  0x4 | pGlobal1         | void*   | Global pointer 0x6f9a8ca4\n  0x14 |  0x4 | szFilename2      | char*   | Pointer to \"type\" (0x6f8fcd0c)\n  0x18 |  0x4 | nCount1          | int     | Count value 15 (0xf)\n  0x1c |  0x4 | reserved3        | int     | Zero\n  0x20 |  0x4 | nValue1          | int     | Value 4\n  0x24 |  0x4 | pGlobal2         | void*   | Global pointer 0x6f9a8ca4\n  0x28 |  0x4 | szFilename3      | char*   | Pointer offset (0x6f8fcd04)\n  0x2c |  0x4 | nCount2          | int     | Count value 15 (0xf)\n  0x30 |  0x4 | reserved4        | int     | Zero\n  0x34 |  0x4 | nValue2          | int     | Value 6\n  0x38 |  0x4 | pGlobal3         | void*   | Global pointer 0x6f9a8ca4\n  0x3c |  0x4 | szFilename4      | char*   | Pointer offset (0x6f8fcd2c)\n  0x40 |  0x4 | reserved5        | int     | Zero\n  0x44 |  0x4 | reserved6        | int     | Zero\n  0x48 |  0x4 | reserved7        | int     | Zero\n  0x4c |  0x4 | reserved8        | int     | Zero",
