      "name": "SetGameEventTimerState",
      "signature": "void SetGameEventTimerState(bool bEnable)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "comment": "Initializes or toggles the game event timer system.\\n\\nWhen enabled (bEnable != 0): activates the timer by setting the event_enabled flag, capturing the current tick count, initializing state, and invoking the event processor.\\nWhen disabled (bEnable == 0): deactivates the timer by clearing the event_enabled flag and invoking the event processor for cleanup.\\n\\nParameters:\\n  bEnable: Timer activation flag (non-zero enables, zero disables)\\n\\nReturns:\\n  void\\n\\nSpecial Cases:\\n  Magic value 0x2 at offset 0x6f921630 indicates specific event processor state\\n  Global 0x6f922338 is the event data structure passed to event processor\\n  GetTickCount() provides wall-clock milliseconds for timer initialization",
