      "signature": "void ValidateAndGetFrameCount(int * pConfig)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "ValidateAndGetFrameCount - Validates configuration and retrieves animation frame count.\n\nThis function performs validation on the provided configuration pointer before\ndispatching to retrieve the frame count for animation processing.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if pConfig pointer is NULL\n2. If NULL, log error message with code 6235 and exit application\n3. Dispatch to DispatchDynamicFunction for frame count retrieval\n4. Call GetFrameCount with validated configuration\n5. Return frame count through configured callback mechanism\n\nParameters:\n- pConfig (int*): Pointer to configuration structure containing animation settings\n                  Must not be NULL or application will terminate\n\nReturns:\n- void: Frame count is returned through indirect callback mechanism\n        Application exits with error if validation fails\n\nError Handling:\n- Logs error 6235 and calls _exit() on NULL pConfig",
      "name_source": "LoD/PD2",
      "method": "API",
      "index": "API:d759c38ed8c6f17b6529b8f41743085c",
