      "calling_convention": "unknown",
      "comment": "JMP thunk to external function at 0x7b662ce0\n\nThis is a simple jump wrapper (thunk) used for calling an external function\nor imported library routine. The function is heavily used throughout the UI\nsystem, particularly by text rendering and measurement functions.\n\nCallers (13): ConvertMouseClickToTextCursorPosition, RenderMultiLineTextControl,\nRenderTextBoxControl, RenderCellFileText, HandleTextInputMouseClick,\nRenderTextBoxUnicodeText, CalculateTextEditCursorPosition, Ordinal_10206,\nThunkOrdinal10055_RegAdapter, WrapTextBoxLine, RenderTextInputControl,\nAdjustTextEditVisibleWindow, CalculateTextRenderHeight\n\nPurpose: Based on caller analysis, this appears to measure text dimensions\nor retrieve text metrics information used for UI layout calculations.\n\nTarget: 0x7b662ce0 (external function)",
