      "name": "BinarySearchTableByKey",
      "signature": "int * BinarySearchTableByKey(ushort searchKey)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "comment": "Binary search function that locates a 14-byte table entry by a ushort key value.\\n\\nAlgorithm:\\n1. Load table metadata from global structure at (DAT_6f901518 + DAT_6f8ffd34 * 0x14)\\n2. Read entry count from offset +8 and subtract 1 to get max index\\n3. Initialize binary search bounds: low=0, high=maxIndex, iterationCount=0\\n4. Perform binary search loop with maximum 1001 iterations (0x3e9):\\n   a. Calculate midIndex = (lowIndex + highIndex) / 2\\n   b. Load ushort key from entry at (tableBase + midIndex * 0xe)\\n   c. Compare searchKey with currentEntryKey\\n   d. If equal, return pointer to matching entry (tableBase + midIndex * 0xe)\\n   e. If searchKey < currentEntryKey, adjust highIndex = midIndex - 1\\n   f. If searchKey > currentEntryKey, adjust lowIndex = midIndex + 1\\n   g. Continue loop if iterationCount < 0x3e9 and lowIndex <= highIndex\\n5. If not found or search exhausted, return fallback entry at (tableBase + 0x1b2)\\n\\nParameters:\\n  searchKey (ushort) - Key value to search for in the table\\n\\nReturns:\\n  int * - Pointer to 14-byte table entry if key found, otherwise pointer to fallback entry at offset +0x1b2\\n\\nSpecial Cases:\\n  - Maximum iteration count: 1001 (0x3e9) prevents infinite loops\\n  - Entry stride: 14 bytes (0xe) per table entry\\n  - Fallback offset: +0x1b2 (434 decimal) for not-found case\\n  - Empty table (max index < 0) returns fallback immediately\\n  - Table accessed via global index DAT_6f8ffd34 multiplied by 0x14 (20 bytes)\\n\\nStructure Layout:\\nGlobal Table Metadata (accessed at offset DAT_6f8ffd34 * 0x14):\\n  Offset  Size  Field Name       Type     Description\\n  +0x8    2     entryCount       ushort   Number of entries in table\\n  +0xc    4     pTableBase       int*     Pointer to table entry array\\n\\nTable Entry Format (14 bytes each):\\n  Offset  Size  Field Name       Type     Description\\n  +0x0    2     key              ushort   Search key value\\n  +0x2    12    data             byte[12] Entry data payload",
      "name_source": "LoD/PD2",
