      "comment": "Thunk function that forwards control to external function at 0x7b662d20.\n\nThis is an import wrapper that performs a simple indirect jump to an external\nfunction. The actual function implementation resides outside this module.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Jump to external function at address 0x7b662d20\n\nReturns:\n  Execution transfers to the external function. Return value and behavior depend\n  on the target function implementation.\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  This is a forwarding thunk with no local logic. All parameters and return values\n  pass through unchanged to the external function.",
